    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Toaster Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/1e1a93c530b594fcd5efd1f90a6c5581.poster.avif?t=1743523665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/1e1a93c530b594fcd5efd1f90a6c5581.webm?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/1e1a93c530b594fcd5efd1f90a6c5581.mp4?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toaster Arena is a game that friends can enjoy together, whether they're in the mood for competitive action or just casual fun. It blends old-school, fast-paced gameplay with modern shooter mechanics, creating a unique and thrilling experience. Dive into intense matches that capture the essence of classic games while enjoying the strategic elements of contemporary shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLE GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes can change the entire experience of the game, offering a variety of play styles to keep things interesting. They range from the chaotic Free For All, where every player is out for themselves, to cooperative team-based modes that require strategy and coordination. For those who love a thrill, there are unique modes like Zombie Infection, where players must survive waves of corrupted attackers. Each mode provides different challenges and dynamics, ensuring that the gameplay remains fresh and engaging no matter how often you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VARIED MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/fc2fb8596ff79976e58e94d8f9014e63.poster.avif?t=1743523665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/fc2fb8596ff79976e58e94d8f9014e63.webm?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/fc2fb8596ff79976e58e94d8f9014e63.mp4?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a rich and diverse selection of maps, each uniquely crafted to provide distinct challenges and experiences. From the intense, claustrophobic environments of close-quarters combat maps, where every turn could lead to a surprise encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Custom Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/105d1506fac4506f29e18415d3785334.poster.avif?t=1743523665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/105d1506fac4506f29e18415d3785334.webm?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/105d1506fac4506f29e18415d3785334.mp4?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With more than 10 unique weapons to choose from, players can customize their loadouts to suit their playstyle. The selection ranges from serious, high-powered options like anti-material sniper rifles to quirky, fun choices like cheese slices. Each weapon behaves differently, offering a unique experience and having a significant impact on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/7a9e591acdb24c789b8fa05a3b300804.poster.avif?t=1743523665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/7a9e591acdb24c789b8fa05a3b300804.webm?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/7a9e591acdb24c789b8fa05a3b300804.mp4?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a wide selection of parts to build your character, ranging from tails and legs to arms and even hats. Each part can be individually colored, allowing for a multitude of unique combinations. Express your creativity by mixing and matching different elements to design a character that truly represents your unique style and preferences. Whether you want a character with a sleek, cohesive look or a wild, colorful appearance, the customization options are extensive and varied, ensuring that no two characters will ever look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Toaster Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/1e1a93c530b594fcd5efd1f90a6c5581.poster.avif?t=1743523665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/1e1a93c530b594fcd5efd1f90a6c5581.webm?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/1e1a93c530b594fcd5efd1f90a6c5581.mp4?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toaster Arena is a game that friends can enjoy together, whether they're in the mood for competitive action or just casual fun. It blends old-school, fast-paced gameplay with modern shooter mechanics, creating a unique and thrilling experience. Dive into intense matches that capture the essence of classic games while enjoying the strategic elements of contemporary shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLE GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes can change the entire experience of the game, offering a variety of play styles to keep things interesting. They range from the chaotic Free For All, where every player is out for themselves, to cooperative team-based modes that require strategy and coordination. For those who love a thrill, there are unique modes like Zombie Infection, where players must survive waves of corrupted attackers. Each mode provides different challenges and dynamics, ensuring that the gameplay remains fresh and engaging no matter how often you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VARIED MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai