ION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/7a9e591acdb24c789b8fa05a3b300804.poster.avif?t=1743523665\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/7a9e591acdb24c789b8fa05a3b300804.webm?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726530/extras/7a9e591acdb24c789b8fa05a3b300804.mp4?t=1743523665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a wide selection of parts to build your character, ranging from tails and legs to arms and even hats. Each part can be individually colored, allowing for a multitude of unique combinations. Express your creativity by mixing and matching different elements to design a character that truly represents your unique style and preferences. Whether you want a character with a sleek, cohesive look or a wild, colorful appearance, the customization options are extensive and varied, ensuring that no two characters will ever look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
